>Waters</surname><given-names>KR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Outcomes of discharge from hospital for elderly people</article-title><source>J Adv Nurs</source><year>1987</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>347</fpage><lpage>355</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3036922</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2648.1987.tb01341.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boter</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Mistiaen</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Duijnhouwer</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Groenewegen</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The problems of elderly patients at home after ophthalmic treatment</article-title><source>J Ophthalmic Nurs Technol</source><year>1998</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>65</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9677974</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Drance</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Difficulties patients have at home after cataract surgery</article-title><source>Can J Ophthalmol</source><year>1984</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>6</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6713269</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bowles</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Naylor</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Foust</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Patient characteristics at hospital discharge and a comparison of home care referral decisions</article-title><source>J Am Geriatr Soc</source><year>2002</year><volu